<title>ESTONIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>ESTONIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970225)</p>
<p> President........Lennart MERI**</p>
<p>(Apptd 5 Oct 92, (**Resigned 25 Feb 97)</p>
<p>re-elected for 5-year term 20 Sep 96)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Formed 5 Nov 95):</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Re-Apptd 17 Oct 95)...........Tiit VAEHI (CP)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture............. Ilmar MAENDMETS (KMU)</p>
<p> Culture.........Jaak ALLIK (CP)</p>
<p> Defence.......Andres OOVEL (CP)</p>
<p> Economy...............Jaak LEIMANN (non-party)</p>
<p> Education................Rein LOIK (non-party)</p>
<p> Environment................Villu REILJAN (KMU)</p>
<p> Finance........Mart OPMANN (CP)</p>
<p> Foreign........ ......Toomas ILVES (non-party)</p>
<p>Interior...Riivo SINIJAERV (CP)</p>
<p> Justice.........Paul VARUL (CP)</p>
<p> Social Affairs............Tiiu ARO (non-party)</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Communication..............Raivo VARE (non-party)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>JUNIOR MINISTERS (Ministers Without Portfolio):</p>
<p> European Affairs..........Andra VEIDEMANN (DP)</p>
<p> Regional Affairs............Tiit KUBRICK (KMU)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p> State Chancellor.............Uno VEERING (KMU)</p>
<p>(NOTE: not technically in cabinet, but can vote)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>CP  -- Coalition Party</p>
<p>DP -- Development Party</p>
<p>KMU -- Rural Union</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Bank of Estonia (Central Bank) President..........Vahur KRAFT</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>		     (End government list)</p>
